.TH IOPL 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
iopl \- changes x86 i/o privilege level; this obsolete operation requires cap_sys_rawio and is architecture dependent
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/io.h>
.B int iopl(int level);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes x86 I/O privilege level; this obsolete operation requires CAP_SYS_RAWIO and is architecture dependent.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR iopl (2)
